<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya kwanja ya Paulo kwa Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Vak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya kwanja lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo kya kwanja kya Vakolindo kikasimbilwe na mnjagila Paulo mumyaka va hamusini na gihanu baada lya kubabwa Yesu. Musula lya 1.1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyi nde baluwa lya kwanja mugati lya baluwa chivili cha Paulo cheavasimbiliye lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito ukoya ku Kolindo. Pangi akasimbile baluwa chipindi kya kwikala ku Ifeso kabula lya natilo lya kugendelela ukoya ku Kolindo peakali lugendo kwelela ukoya kuchumbila ku Makedenia musula lya 16.5-9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa iyi ndelihigo lya njowo cheawanuke Paulo kuhuma kwa vamonga va vanu kuhuma kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito kutigila makani manjanganifu gegikali gihumila, gakiva kuyaganika na ugoni. Mwani va Kolindo ukachelike hilo kwa lukani lwa ugoni, kwa ndeni selukani lwa kududuva kuhumila ata mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito lya ukoya ku Kolindo likali na makani aga. Kangi Vakolindo va kwanja, kugehe na sula yeichelwa hilo lya lukelo, musula lya 13.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo akuvahungila Vakolindo na kumuhongecha Nguluvi kwakuva lyawo musula lya 1.1-9.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi, ihumulila makani gyeawanuke kutigila kuyaganika mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito va ukoya ku Kolindo musula 1.10—4.21.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndeni ndeni, ihumulila makani gya ugoni na makani ga kwisindika ku lidamo musula lya 5-6.</para>
  <para style="io">Peamalile ago, akahumulila lulagilicho kutigila kutola na kutawuka, kuhecha usembe kwa ming'omong'omo, lufunyo lwa kudadava, fupo cha kimuhe na makani ga kuchulubuka musula lya 7-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Asindile kwa kulagicha makani geging'ang'wa kugitwa ila na makani ga munu yumwi yumwi musula lya 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Nene Paulo, ndikemeliwe kuvecha mnjagila va Yesu Kilisito ngita peikela Nguluvi. Baluwa iyi ndisimbile nene na lukolo lwetu Sositeni.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Tukuvasimbila nyenye lipinga lya vanu vemumdikiye Kilisito ukoya Kolindo. Nyenye nyemugitilwe vang'alile kwakwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu, muhaguliwe kuvecha vanu va Nguluvi pamwi na vanu vonda na konda vevakumusuka Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito yeagehe Mtwa venu na Mtwa vetu nefwe.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi Daada vetu na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito avagavile usanzi na lutengamaso.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluvi atufunyile kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi vangu figono fyonda kwakuva lya nyenye, kwa usanzi vake yeavagavile kuchumbila Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito, Nguluvi avagavile kila kinu kyemung'ang'a na nondee mugehe na umwimike va kulonga kila kinu kyeasaka Nguluvi mulonge na kuchela kila kinu kyeasaka Nguluvi muchele. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Makani ago giwonesa kuva njowo cha Yesu Kilisito chetudalike kwa nyenye ndi cha undakyene, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />ata semukapwemuka na fupo kuhuma kwa Muhe va Nguluvi pemuchindila kwa ng'elu ngomi kuwuya kwa Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Nguluvi dakuvakangamicha ludali mbaka kumwiso neke mubihile kuwoneka na nongwa mukigono kila kya kuwuya kwa Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Nguluvi daigita ago, kwakuva mwene ndi mndakyene. Mwene nde yeavakemeliye nyenye neke mwiwunge na Mwana vake Yesu Kilisito Mtwa vetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyaganika kwa lipinga lya vanu vevakumudikila Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Ndeni, vakolo vangu muumwimike va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, ndikuvasuka nyenye vonda mubihile kwipinja kwa gala gyemwilonga neke kubihile kuvecha na mayaganiko pagati lyenu, muveche na lihocho limwi na natilo yimwi. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Vakolo vangu makani gyendipatile kuhuma kwa vanu vamonga va kukaye lya Kuloe gilonga vachi kuva kugehe na ndewo pagati lyenu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Kila yumwi venu ilonga ndeni, “Nene ndikumfwata Paulo.” Na yungi ilonga kuva nene ndikumfwata Apolo, yungi ilonga “Nene ndikumfwata Peteli.” Na yungi ilonga “Nene ndikumfwata Kilisito”. <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Wuli, Kilisito agawanike? Wuli, Pauli nde yeavambilwe pakipindilihicho kwakuva lya nyenye? Awu mukabatiswe kwa litawa lya Paulo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi kwakuva sendikumbatisa munu yeyonda mugati lyenu ila Kilisipo na Gayo hela. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Kwihela munu yeivesa kulonga kuva abatiswe kwa litawa lyangu, <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />ena, ndikavabatise vanu vonda va kaye lya Sitefano, ila sendiwiwuka kuva ndikavabatisa na vanu vangi. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kilisito seanilagiliche kuvabatisa vanu ila kudalika Njowo Nofu na ndigite ndeni se kwa kulonga njowo cha uginyange cha vanu cha kuvayovelecha, neke kufuwa kwa Kilisito pakipindilihicho kubihile kuyaganicha ludali chake.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito nde ludali na uginyange va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Kwakuva unanzi va kufuwa kwa Kilisito Yesu palipindilihicho nde lukani lwa upufi kwa vala veviyaga, ila nefwe yetulowolilwa, unanzi uwo nde ludali lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Dandihananga uginyange va vene uginyange</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">dandikana luhala, vevakwimbile.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Nondee, agehe kwiya mwene uginyange? Agehe kwiya muwulanichi va malagicho? Agehe kwiya yeivesa kwipinja chipindi ichi? Nguluvi agitile uginyange va inyi ugu kuvecha upufi.<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Kwakuva muuginyange va Nguluvi, vanu sevawesa kumchela Nguluvi kwa kuhuvilila uginyange vawo. Ila Nguluvi akeliye kuvalowa vala vevadikila wula unanzi vetukuudalika, veukemilwe na vene uginyange kuva ndi upufi. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Vayahudi visaka vimanyilo neke vadikile na Vagiliki visaka uginyange neke vadikile. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Ila nefwe tukumlandula Kilisito yeavambilwe palipimdilihicho, unanzi ugu kwa Vayahudi ukuvagita vavipe na kwa vanu se Vayawudi nde upufi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Ila kwa vala vonda vevakemeliwe na Nguluvi vaveche Vayawudi awu vaveche vanu se Vayawudi, Kilisito nde ludali lwa Nguluvi na uginyange va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Kwakuva kyekiwonekana nde upufi va Nguluvi nde uginyange kuchumba uginyange va vanu na kila kyekiwoneka kuva nde usosovafu va Nguluvi, kigehe na ludali kuchumba ludali lwa vanu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Vakolo vangu muwuwike chipindi Nguluvi peavakemeliye, volofu mugati venu vakali viwoneka ngita vihela uginyange pautalo lya vanu, kangi volofu semukachelilwe hilo na vanu, kangi semukababilwe mukaye cha vanu vakomi. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Ila Nguluvi akahagule makani gyegiwoneka na vanu kuva ndi gya upufi, neke avagavile soni vanu vene uginyange, kangi Nguluvi akahaguwe makani gyegiwoneka kwa vanu kuva gihela ludali neke avagavile soni vanu vene ludali, <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Kangi Nguluvi akahaguwe makani gyegiwoneka kwa vanu kuva ndi ga panyi na kubedwa na veviwoneka kuva se kinu neke afihanange finu fyefiwoneka na vanu kuva ndi ngiba. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Nguluvi akagitile ndeni neke munu yeyonda abihile kwidumba pautalo lyake. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Nguluvi nde yeavawunganise nyenye na Kilisito Yesu. Nguluvi amgitile Kilisito aveche mginyange vetu. Kuchumbila mwene tudikilwa na Nguluvi, tuvecha vanu va Nguluvi yetukomboliwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Suwe, ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">“Yeikela kwidumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">na adumbe kwa kasi yeagitile Mtwa.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Kumlanducha Kilisito yeakavambilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Vakolo vangu, chipindi pendachile kwa nyenye, kudalika unanzi va undakyene va Nguluvi, sendikali ndilonga kuwonesa kuva ndiwesa kulonga unofu awu kwakuva ndigehe na uginyange. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Kwakuva ndikalamuwe pendivecha kwa nyenye ndilonge makani ga Yesu Kilisito hela, hilo ndilonge makani ga kufuwa kwa mwene pakipindilihicho ngajila kulonga makani gangi. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Pendikali kwa nyenye ndikali msosovafu na munya wogofi hilo. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Chipindi pendikali ndi wulanicha na kudalika sendikali ndilonga njowo neke nyenye muniwene ndigehe na uginyange, ila ludali cha muhe va Nguluvi chikali chiwonesa undakyene. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Ndikagitile ndeni neke ludikilo lwenu uveche kuhuvila ludali lwa Nguluvi na se uginyange va vanu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uginyange va Nguluvi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Ila igehe uginyange yetukuilonga kwa vanu vevamudikile Kilisito hilo, ila seuginyange va inyi, vala vevakuitavala inyi iyi vagehe na mwiso va kutavala, <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />uginyange yetukuilonga nde uginyange va lupwepo lwa Nguluvi yeifiamichwe kwa vanu, ambavo Nguluvi akalongile kuhuma pamwandi neke kutugavila usanzi vetu. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Kwihela vatavala va inyi iyi yevachela uginyange ugu. Ngita ngavachela ngasevamvambile palipindilihicho Mtwa va kuginywa yeatavala kuluhano na muinyi. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Kwihela munu yeawesile kulolela vala kupulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">vala kwihela munu yeiwesa kuhocha kyekihumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">ago Nguluvi gyeagavikile kwa vala vevakumkela.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ila nefwe Nguluvi atuwonisile makani ago, kuchumbila Muhe vake. Kwakuva Muhe vake ilolela kila kinu, ata makani gyegifyamilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Nde ani yeivesa kuchela mahocho ga munu, ngita se muhe vake munu uyo? Ndeni ndeni, kwihela munu yeichela makani gya Nguluvi ila Muhe vake. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Nondee, nefwe setukawanuke Muhe va inyi, ila tukawanuke Muhe veuhumile kwa Nguluvi neke atugite tuveche kugachela gala gyetugavilwe na Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Ila nefwe setulonga kwa makani gyetuwulanichwe kwa uginyange va munu, ila kwa makani gyetuwalanichwe na Muhe va Nguluvi, tukilonga makani gya Muhe kwa vala vanu vene Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Munu yeihela Muhe va Nguluvi, seawesa kuwanuka makani gyegihuma kwa Muhe va Nguluvi. Vihocha kuva nde makani gya upufi. Seiwesa kuchela kwakuva ago chichelwa kwa lutango lwa Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Ila munu yeilongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi mwene ichela makani gyonda, ila vanu vangi sevawesa kumchela mwene. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Nde ani yeichela mahocho ga Mtwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Nde ani ivesa kumuwulanicha?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Ila nefwe tunagyo mahocho gegihuma kwa Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Vanjagila va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Vakolo vangu, sendikaywangile na nyenye ngita vanu vemugehe na Muhe va Nguluvi. Ndikang'ang'ile kulonga na nyenye ngita vanu vevilongochwa na makani ga inyi, kangi ngita fyali vevikwikala mugati lya Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Ndikavawulanicha mawulanicho mapefu kuchelwa ngita maye peakumgavila mavele mwana vake. Kwakuva semukawesile kuwanuka kyakula kigamu na ata nondee semuwesa kuwanuka mawulanicho makangafu ga Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Kwakuva mwikala ngita vanu vevilongochwa na makani ga muinyi. Mulolele pagati lyenu kugehe na wifu na ndewo, ago giwonesa kuva nyenye mulongochwa na makani ga muinyi na mwikala kwa fwata ludoboko cha inyi. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Yumwi venu peilonga, “Nene nde va Paulo”, “Yungi nene nde va Apolo”, Wuli, iyo seiwonesa kuva mukwikala ngita vanu va muinyi?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Apolo nde ani? Paulo nde ani? Nefwe nde vandumindumi va Nguluvi. Kila yumwi vetu igita kasi yeagavilwe na Mtwa. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Pendivalongile Njowo Nofu cha Nguluvi, ndikali ngita munu yeivyala mbeyu, ila Apolo akasukulila malenga, ila Nguluvi yeigita fimele na kukula. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Yeavyalile se kinu na yeasukulile malenga se kinu, ila kinu ndi Nguluvi kwakuva mwene yeagitile kila kinu fikule. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Yula yeavyalile na yeasukulile malenga vonda vakali na natilo limwi, ila kila yumwi iwanuka fupo lyake kuhumana na kasi yeigitile. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Kwakuva nefwe tugita kasi pamwi na Nguluvi, nyenye ndi mgunda va Nguluvi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Kangi nyenye kaye lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kwa usanzi veanigavile Nguluvi, nene ngita mchengaji yendichela kasi lyangu, ndikachengile kitamiko ambago munu yungi ichenga kukyanya lya kitamiko ugo, ila kila yumwi ing'ang'wa alolele peichenga kukyanya lyake. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Kwihela munu yeivesa kuuvangicha kitamiko wungi, badala va wula veuvikilwe suwe, kitamiko ugo nde Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Pakyanya lya kitamiko ikyo munu ivecha kuchenga kwa madini gikemelwa sahabu awu madini gyegikemelwa feza awu maganga, ivecha kuchengelwa kwa simbili awu mikwati awu misoli. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Kila kasi yeigita munu daiwonekana kigono kila kya luhigo pekikwacha. Baho iwonekane inofu awu seinofu kigono ikyo kila kasi lya munu igechwa kwa lyoto. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Nguluvi dakumgavila fupo munu yeachengile kukyanya lya kitamiko ugo, ikiva kasi lyake sedaipiya na lyoto. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ila ngita kasi lya munu igite kupiya, baho sedaigavilwa fupo lyake. Ila mwene dailowelwa ngita munu yeilowolwa mulyoto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Wuli, semuchela kuva nyenye nde kaye lya Nguluvi, kuva Muhe va Nguluvi akwikala mugati lyenu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Ngita munu akihananga Kaye lya Nguluvi, Nguluvi akumuhananga munu uyo. Na nyenye nde kaye lya Nguluvi. Nyenye nde mali lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Mubihile kwichanga. Munu yeyonda mugati lyenu kuhocha kuva agehe na uginyange muinyi iyi, ngiba aveche mpufi neke aveche na uginyange va undakyene. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Kwakuva uginyange va inyi ndi upufi pautalo lwa Nguluvi. Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, “Nguluvi akuvagomecha vene uginyange muusugu gyawo”. <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Kangi isimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, “Mtwa akugachela kuva mahocho gya vanu vene uginyange sekinu.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Kwakuva lya ago mubihile kwidumbila kilongochi yeyonda, kwakuva filongochi vonda vavikilwe kwa kuvatanga nyenye, ngita vanu va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Ndiveche nene Paulo awu Apolo awu Kefa. Kangi Nguluvi avagavile finu fyonda kuvatanga fiveche fya muinyi awu uwumi awu kufuwa awu fila fyefigehe nondee awu fila dafikwacha fyonda ndi fya nyenye, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />ila nyenye ndi vanu va Kilisito na Kilisito mwene ndi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Vanjagila va Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Suwe, vanu vatulolele kuva nefwe ndi vanjagila va Kilisito vetugavilwe lupwepo lwa Nguluvi tuchidalike. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Nondee, munu yeagavilwe kasi iyi ing'ang'wa kuvecha munu msanzi. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Kwa nene sekinu, kuhigwa na nyenye awu kuhigwa na ludamo lwa vanu, vala sendikwihiga yune. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Kwakuva sendihigwa kwa lyolyonda munumbula lwangu. Ila ilyo selikunigita ndiveche ndihela nongwa, Mtwa nde yeakunihiga. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Suwe, mubihile kuhiga munu yeyonda, mumchindile Mtwa peikwacha. Mwene akugagubutula makani mahofu gyegyafyamile na kuwonesa wachi kuva numbula cha vanu chikela liki. Baho kila yumwi ipatila njumwa yeing'ag'wa kugavilwa.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Vakolo vangu, ago gendilongile kwa njowo cha Apolo na nene, neke gavatange nyenye. Kuhumila na mufanu ugu va Apolo na nene nding'ang'a muchele mana lya njowo ichi, “Mugafwate gegasimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi.” Pagati lyenu kubihile kuvecha na munu yeyonda yeakwidumbila munu yumwi na kumbeda yungi. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Ani yeakumwilile veve? Kinu liki veve seugavilwe? Ila ngita ugavilwe wuli ukwidumba ngita seugavilwe?.<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Nondee mufipatile suwe fyonda! Muvechile vamosi suwe! Muvechile vang'achale ngajila nefwe! Ngita ngamuvechile vang'achile ndakyene neke na nefwe tupatile kuvecha vang'achale pamwi na nyenye. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ila nefwe vanjagila ndilola kuva Nguluvi atuvikile vanu va kubedwa kuchumba vanu vonda, tugehe ngita vanu vevahigilwe kufuwa pautalo lya vanu, tugitilwe ngita vanu vakuhekwa baha painyi na kwa vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Ngulivi na kwa vanu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Ila vanu volofu vakutulola nefwe ngita vapufi kwakuva lya kumgundamikila Kilisito, ila nyenye mwikwilola mugehe na uginyange kwakuva mukumfwatila Kilisito! Nefwe tuwoneka tuhela ludali ila nyenye mwiwoneka muna ludali, nyenye muginywa, ila nefwe twibedwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Mbaka nondee, nefwe tugehe na njala na ng'elu, twihela myenda na twitovwa na twihela pono pa kwikala. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Kangi twiguda na kugita kasi kwa mawoko gyetu. Vanu pevakutuliga tukumsuka Nguluvi avafunye, vanu pevakutugitila uwofu tukuvahuvilila, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />vanu pevakutusingisila, nefwe twihiga kwa ufokomasi. Ata nondee twiwoneka ngita uhafu mu inyi iyi kangi setung'ang'a hilo. <verse eid="1CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Sendisimba makani aga kwajili lya kuvakafuwa nyenye ila kwajili lya kuwawulanicha vana vangu vendikuvakela. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ata ngita mugehe na vawulanichi volofu hilo kwa kwiwunga na kilisito, ila daada venu ndi yumwi hela. Nene ndikali daada venu kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito, kwakuva ndikavadalikile Njowo Nofu.<verse eid="1CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Ndeni, ndikuvasuka hilo mugite ngita pendigita nene. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Kwakuva ndimlagiliche Timotewo kwa nyenye. Mwene nde mwana vangu yendimkeliye yeihuvilila mukasi lya Mtwa. Mwene davawuwisa makani gyendikugafwata kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito, makani gyendiwulanicha kila mumapinga gya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Vamonga venu vavangile kwidumba vakihocha kuva sendikwacha kangi kwa nyenye. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Ila ngita Nguluvi peikela, dandikwacha kisatu. Baho dandigachela makani gyegilongwa na avo vanu vevikwidumba na ndichele kuva vagehe na ludali cha Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kwakuva Ung'achale va Nguluvi se kwa malichwi hela, ila mugala gevawesa kugagita muludali lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Wuli, mwikela ndigite liki? Ndache na lubiki awu ndache na numbula lya lukelo na ufokomasi.<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Mwinenge na ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Kugehe na njowo chilutiye kuva kugehe na ugoni mugati lyenu, ugoni weseugehe ata kwa vanu sevamchele Nguluvi. Ndilongilwe kugehe na munu igona na mdala va daada vake! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Mwivecha wuli kwidumba? Ngaivecha ngiba kwa nyenye kusugwima na kumuhecha mugati lyenu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Ata ngita ndigehe kutali na nyenye ila numbula lyangu ugehe pamwi na nyenye. Ndeni, ngita fila ndigehe baho ndimuhigile suwe munu yeagitile lukani ulu lwa nyoni. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Pemwitang'ana pamwi kwa kumsuka Mtwa Yesu na numbula lyangu uvecha pamwi na nyenye na kangi ludali lwa Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito chivecha pamwi na nyenye, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />mumleke munu uyo mumawoko gya Setani, neke muvili vake ugudiswe na muhe vake ulowolwe kigono kya kuwuya kwa Mtwa.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Kwidumba kwa nyenye se unofu. Wuli, semwichela kuva lisimika lidodo ligita utine wonda vakugelenicha libumunda kuvecha na lisimika? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Suwe, mwing'aliche kwa kumuhecha munu uyo muhofu mugati lyenu, kugita ndeni, iwana kuhecha lisimika lya dahila. Baho damuvecha vanu vamiya ngita utine veugalanichwe seuvikilwe lisimika na ndeni nde pemugehe nyenye. Kwakuva, Nguluvi akamuhechile Kilisito kuvecha usembe, ngita mwana ng'ondolo va Pasaka neke atulowole. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Suwe, tugite lihungu ilyo se kwa lisimika lya daha, ambalyo nde unjanganifu na sambi, ila kwa libumunda lye selivikilwe lisimika, nde numbula nofu na undakyene.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Ndikavasimbiye mubaluwa lyangu kuva mubihile kwiwunga pamwi na vagoni. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Ila sendikali na mana muleke kwiwunga na vanu va muinyi ugu, sengaivecha ndeni, ngamung'ang'ilwe kuhenga muinyi ugu neke mwinenge na vagoni na mwimi na vafyangu na vevakuifunya ling'omong'omo. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Ila ndikavasimbiye, mubihile kwiwunga na munu yeakwikemela akumdikila Kilisito ngita nyenye, ila mwene ndi mgona na mwimi na yeakumgundamila ling'omong'omo na yeyiyovelecha na mgalaji na muhichi. Munu yeagehe ndeni, ata kulya mubihile kulya pamwi na mwene.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Se kasi lyangu kuvahiga vanu vevagehe kwivala lya lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito, avo Nguluvi yumwene nde dakuvahiga. Ila nyenye mwing'ang'wa kuvahiga vanu vevagehe mulipinga lyenu. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Nguluvi dakuvahiga vala vevagehe kwivala lya lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito. Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, “Muheche munu muhofu pagati lyenu.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Vanu vevamwidikiye kilisito vanjengekaye vavene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ngita munu yeyonda mugati lyenu agehe na ndewo na muyage, igecha wuli kumulata lukolo yeadikiye pautalo lya ludamo lya vanu seyevamchelile Nguluvi badala lya kulata pautalo lya vanu vevamchele Nguluvi? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Wuli, semwichela kuva vanu vevamuidikiye Nguluvi davahiga vanu va inyi ugu? Suwe, ikiva nyenye damuhiga vanu va inyi ugu, mwilemwa wuli kuhiga makani madodo madodo hela? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Wuli, semwichela kuva datukuvahiga ndumindumi va Nguluvi? Ngita ndeni, mwing'ang'wa kumalila nongwa ndodondodo ga uwumi vetu ugu. <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Wuli, mukuvakemela vanu vevihela kyanda nofu vache kunjengakaya nongwa chenu? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ndilonga ndena, neke mulole nyoni. Wuli, kwihela ata yumwi mugati lyenu munya uginyange va kuvanjengakaya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Ila nyenye muna kyanda lya kwilata mdikila kwa mdikila?<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Pemwilata ndeni mwiwonesa kuva mlemwile hilo. Ngaivecha unofu kwa nyenye kumleka munu akugitile uwofu awu kunyaga finu fyenu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Ila nyenye nde mwisulumu vanu na kunyaga finu fyawo, kangi mwigita ata kwa vadikila vayenu! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Awu se muchela kuva vanu vahofu setupata ung'achale va Nguluvi? Mbihile kwichanga! Vanu vagoni na vevakugundamila ling'omong'omo na vagosi vevidobokelana na kugona pamwi, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />vahichi na mwimi na vagala na vaheha na vanyaga, avo vonda seviwecha ku Ung'achale va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Vamonga venu mukali ngita avo. Ila nondee muwogofichwe kuhuma musambi na kunengwa muveche vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kuchumbila Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito na kwa Muhe va Nguluvi vetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwikale kwa kumnjuma Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Munu ivecha kulonga kuva, “Ndidikilwe kugita kila kinu.” Ena, ila sekila kinu ngiba kwa nene. Ndidikilwe kugita kila kinu kyendikela ila sendivecha msutu va kinu kyokyonda. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Vamonga venu vilonga, “Munu peivecha na njala ing'ang'wa kuliya, kwakuva mivili ging'ang'a kuliya.” Nde peigehe, ila chipindi kikwacha, Nguluvi daigalambucha mivili gyenu daivecha seing'ang'a kyakuliya. Ila nondee mbihile kulonga kuva tung'ang'awa kugita ugoni, ngita peing'ang'awa kuliya chipindi pemuvecha na njala. Nguluvi seakawumbile mivili gyenu kwakuva lya ugoni, ila kwakuva lya kumgumbanila Mtwa na mwene Mtwa akugivika unofu mivili. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Kwa ludali lwake Nguluvi amchulubuche Mtwa na kangi datuchulubucha na nefwe. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Wuli, Semuchela kuva mivili gyenu nde fiwungo fya Kilisito? Wuli, mwivesa kunyamula muvili va Kilisito na kugita pono lya muvili lya mgoni? Hamu. <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Kwakuva, ngita mwichela kuva yeavecha pamwi na mgoni ivecha muvili gumwi na mwene, ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, “Navo vavili davivecha muvili umwi.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Ila yeagehe pamwi na Mtwa ivecha muhe wumwi na Mtwa. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Muyiyepe na ugoni. Sambi chingi chonda ugitwa kwivala lya muvili, ila mgoni agita sambi kwa muvili vake mwene. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Semuchela kuva mivili gyenu nde Kaye lya Muhe va Nguluvi yeagehe mugati lyenu yemumuwanuke kuhuma kwa Nguluvi, nondee mivili igo se gyenu ila ndi gya Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Kwakuva Nguluvi avagulile kwa sendi ngomi. Ndeni mumnjume Nguluvi kwa mivili gyenu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Malagilicho ga kutola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Suwe, kutiya gala makani gye mkanisimbiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Kuva ndi unofu mgosi abihile kutola. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Ila kwakuva vanu vongofu vigita ugoni hilo, suwe, kila mgosi aveche na mdala vake na kila mdala aveche na mgosi vake. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Mgosi amgitiye mdala vake ngita peing'ang'a na mdala amgitiye mgosi vake ngita peing'ang'a. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Mdala ihela umwimike pakyanya lya muvili vake, ila mgosi vake nde ana umwike. Ndeni ndeni mgosi ihela umwimke pakyanya lya muvili vake ila mdala vake nde ana umwimike. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Mubihile kwikacha mivili gyenu. Ila ngita mwidikilane kuleka kwa chipindi chidodo hela mwiyeche kwa Nguluvi, pambele mwiwuyile neke Setani abihile kuvagecha kuhumana kwa kuyihunichila.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Gendikuvalongela nondee ndi njengakaya, ila se lulakililo.<verse eid="1CO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ndikela kila munu aveche ngita nene pendigehe. Ila kila yumwi agehe na kipanji kyake kuhuma kwa Nguluvi, yumwi kipanji kila na yungi iki.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Ila vala vevave kutola na vave kutauka na vagane, ndikuvalongela kuva ndingiba kusigala ngajila kutola awu kutauka ngita nene. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Ila ngaseviwesa kwikanila ngiba mtole na mtawike. Ndigiba kutola awu kutauka kuliko kuvecha na ludoboko.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Kwa vala vevatolile ndigehe na Lulagilicho, kangi selulagilicho lwa nene ila lwa Mtwa. Mdala abihile kumuleka mgosi vake, <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />ila ngavilekine ing'ang'wa akale ngajila kutauka kangi, awu vanjengekaya na mgosi vake na kuwuyana. Mgosi nave abihile kumuleka mdala vake.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Kwa vanu vangi, nene ndikuvalonge ila se Mtwa. Ndilonga ndena, ikiva mgosi yeamuidikiye Kilisto agehe na mdala yeseamuidikiye Kilisito na uyo mdala akadikiye kwikala nave abihile kumleka. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Na mdala yeamuidikiye Kilisito ngaagehe na mgosi yeseamuidikiye Kilisito na mgosi uyo akadikiye kwikala nave, suwe abihile kumleka mgosi vake. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kwakuva mgosi yeseamudikiye Kilisito ihanukwa kwa Nguluvi kwakuvecha pamwi na mdala vake. Na uyo mdala yeseamudikiye Kilisito ihanukwa kwa Nguluvi kwa kuvecha pamwi na mgosi vake. Ngita sengaivecha ndeni vana vawo sengawanukwa na Nguluvi, ila nondee vawanukwa na Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ila mgosi awu mdala yeseamudikiye Kilisito ngaisaka kuhega kwa mdala vake awu mgosi vake, mgosi awu mdala yeamudikiye Kilisito ivecha pekesu. Kwakuva Nguluvi atukemeliye twikale kwa lutengemaso. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Veve mdala veumudikiye Kilisito, uchela wuli kuva wiwesa kumlowa mgosi vako? Awu veve mgosi uchela wuli kuva wiwesa kumlowa mdala vako?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwikale ngita Nguluvi peavakemeliye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Kila yumwi venu ing'ang'wa kwikala kuhumana na fipanji fyeagavilwe na Nguluvi na ngita peakemeliwe na Nguluvi. Ulu nde lulagilicho lwendihecha mulipinga gyonda ga vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ngita munu akemeliwe na Nguluvi chipindi adumuliwe bina suwe, ndeni, abihile kwilongela kuva sendidumuhe bina na ngita akemeliwe akiva ave kudumulwa bina, abihile kudumulwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kwakuva kudumulwa bina awu sekudumula bina sekinu, kyeking'ang'wa nde kukolela malagilicho gya Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Suwe, kila yumwi nde asigale ngita peakali chipindi peakemeliwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Wuli, veve peukemeliwe na Nguluvi ukali msutu? Suwe, bihile kuhocha, ila ngita mtwa vako akulekelele, veve helele. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Kwakuva, yeakemeliwe na Mtwa akivecha msutu, suwe munu uyo ivecha alekelwe kwa Mtwa. Ndeni ndeni yeakemeliwe akivecha alekelichwe ivecha msutu va Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Nguluvi akavagulile kwa sendi ngomi kwakuva lya nyenye, nondee mubihile kuvecha vasutu va vanu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Vakolo vangu muwumi vetu umiya pamwi na Nguluvi kila yumwi venu ing'ang'wa kwendelela kwikala ngita peakemeliwe na Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanicho gasevatolile na vagane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Nondee, ndikuvalongela kwa makani gala gyemunihuchile kwa njowo cha vanu vesevatolile na vesevatolilwe, ndihela lulagilicho kuhuma kwa Mtwa kyanya lya makani ago, ago ndi malagilicho gyangu kwakuva Mtwa aniwonile lusungu, suwe muwesa kunidikila nene.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Suwe, kwakuva kugehe na utatala wolofu figono ifi, ndihocha ngiba kila munu asigale ngita peagehe. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Wuli, utolile? Suwe, ubihile kumuleka mdala vako. Veve seutolile? Suwe, ubihile kutola. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Ila ngita utolile sedaugitile sambi na mkidala ngita daatawike sedaagitile sambi. Ila vevitolile davipata magudo muwumi ugu, nene ndikela magudo ago gabihile kugapata nyenye. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Vakolo vangu, ndisaka kulonga ndena. Chipindi che chisigiye mbaka Kilisito peiwuya nde chidodo. Ndeni, yevatolile vabihile kuvahochela vadala vake hela ila vagite kasi cha Mtwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />Vevivemba vaveche ngita sevivemba na vevikeduka vaveche ngita sevikeduka na vevigula finu vaveche ngita vihela finu. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Na vevakuikumbanikila inyi vaveche ngita sevakuikumbanikila. Kwakuva inyi iyi twichela yigehe na mwiso.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Ndikela nyenye mubihile kuvecha na wogofi. Munu yeihela mdala igita kasi lya Mtwa neke amukelese Mtwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Ila mgosi yeatolile igita kasi muuwumi ugu, kwakuva ihocha amukelise mdala vake, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />kangi ikwengwa mumakani gavili pagati lya mdala na mkidala. Mkidala ikumbanikila makani ga Mtwa neke aveche mng'alile mumvili na mumuhe, ila yula ye atawike ikumbanikila makani gya uwumi ugu, neke amukelese mgosi vake.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Ndikuvalongela makani aga kwa kuvatanga nyenye na se kwa kuvakanila. Ila ndisaka mwikale ngita peing'ang'wa, ndisaka mumkumbanikile Mtwa kwa numbula na natilo imwi.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ngita munu iwona kuva seakumgitila unofu mkidala vake peibihila kumtola na ngita ing'ang'a kumtola agite ngita peikela. Baho daivecha seagitile sambi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ila ngita uyo mkigosi ngita ilamula yumwene kuhuma munumbula lyake kuva seitola na ngita iwesa kuchitavala ludoboko lwake na kulamula liki kya kugita, suwe, daigita lukani lunofu hilo ngita seakumtola mkidala uyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Suwe, yula yeitola igita unofu na yula seitola igita unofu hilo.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Mdala yeatawike awopilwe na mgosi vake chipindi chonda mgosi vake peagehe wumi. Ila mgosi vake ngita ifuwa mdala uyo ivecha pekesu na akikela ivesa kutawuka na mkigosi yeyonda, ila mgosi uyo aveche akumudikila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Ila nene ndilola daivecha ngiba abihile kutawuka. Ago ndi mahocho gangu na nene ndilonga ndeni, kwa kulongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Mahucho ga fyakuliya fya kutambikila ming'omong'omo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Suwe, kutigila kyakulya kya kutambikila ming'omong'omo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Ndichela mlonga kuva, “Nefwe vonda tugehe na luchelo.” Ila luchelo ulo ukuvagita vanu vayidumbe, ila lukelo ukuvagangamicha volofu muludikilo. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Munu yeihocha kuva ichela kinu, ndakyene uyo seichela kinu kyokyonda ngita peing'ang'wa kuchelwa. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Ila ngita munu akumkela Nguluvi, munu uyo ichelwa na Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Ndeni, kutigila kyakulya kyekihechelwa tambiko kwa ming'omongomo, twichela kuva ming'omong'omo sekinu muinyi, twichela kuva kwihela valungulu vangi, ila Nguluvi agehe yumwi hela. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ata ngita figehe finu fyefikemelwa valungulu vangu muinyi awu kuluhano na ata ngita kovali, valungulu volofu na vatwa volofu, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />ila kwa nefwe agehe Nguluvi yumwi hela, mwene nde Daada yeaumbile finu fyonda na nefwe twikala neke tumugundamikile mwene. Kangi agehe Mtwa yumwi hela, nde Yesu Kilisito, kuchumbila mwene finu fyonda fiwumbilwe na nefwe twikwikala kwa ng'asi lyake. <verse eid="1CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Ila sekila vanu vonda vichela undakyene ugo, kwakuva vagehe volofu vevachoviye kugundamikila ming'omong'omo, mbaka nondee peviliya fyakulya ifyo, vakwiwona ngita vitambikilwe ming'omong'omo. Ndeni, vakwiwona vigita sambi, kwakuva sevakangiye muludikilo. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Ila kyakula sekiwesa kutuvika pepi na Nguluvi. Ata ngita tuliya kyakula setupwemuka na kinu na ata ngita tuliya setwikongelechwa kinu.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ila mwilolele, upekesu venu ubihile kuvagita vangi, vevagehe na ludikilo usosovafu mubihile kuvagita vagite sambi. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Kwakuva munu munya ludikilo sosovafu, peakulola veve munya luchelo wiliya kyakula ikyo mugati lya kaye lya ming'omong'omo, wuli, seukumdobocha kulya kyakulya kyekitambikilwe ming'omong'omo? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Ndeni, uyo lukolo vako msosovafu va numbula ambalye Kilisito akafuwe kwajili lyake, daiyaga kwakuva lya luchelo lwako. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ngita mukuvagita vakolo venu vagite sambi na kuvalemacha numbula chawo, damuvecha mumkosiye Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Ndeni, ngita kila kyendiliya kikumgita lukolo vangu agite sambi, sendiliya ng'odo huchi, neke ndibihile kumgita mdikila mweyangu, agite sambi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Kasi cha vanjagila na kyevang'ang'a kupatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Wuli, nene semunu yendigehe pekesu? Wuli, nene semnjagila? Wuli, nene sendikamuwene Yesu Mtwa vetu? Wuli, kasi yendiigitile nene sende ivagitile nyenye kumdikila Mtwa?<verse eid="1CO 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Ata ngita vanu vangi vakuniwona se mnjagila, ndakyene nene ndi mnjagila kwa nyenye, kwakuva ludikilo lwenu kwa Mtwa iwonesa kuva nene ndilagilichwe na Mtwa.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Ilyo nde luchowo lwangu kwa vala vanu vevakunipinja, <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />wuli, nefwe setung'ang'wa kugavilwa fyakuliya na finu fya kunyuwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Wuli, setung'ang'wa kuvanyamula vadala vetu yevamudikiye Kilisito mulugendo chetu, ngita pevagita vanjagila vangi na vakolo vake Mtwa na ata Kefa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Awu ndi nene hela na Balinaba vetung'ang'wa kugita kasi kwajili lya kwikala kwa nefwe? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Wuli, ndi mpuga ani yeihelela kufita chipindi chonda kwa sendi chake yumwene? Wuli, mgima ani yeseiliya manunu gya mgunda vake va misabibu? Wuli, nde ani yeikwamila lipinga lya vang'ong'oko na seinyuwa mavele gya vang'oko vake?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Njowo ichi chendilonga semahocho ga vanu hela, ila ata malagilicho ga Musa gilonga ndeni ndeni. <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Kwakuva isimbilwe mululagilicho lwa Musa, “Ubihile kumuwopa mlomo senga peiliya mabenelo.” Wuli, Nguluvi pealongile ndeni akali iywanga makani ga senga? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Wuli, seakali ilonga ago kwakuva lya nefwe? Ena, kwakuva yula yeigima na yula yeibena vonda vavili vang'ang'wa kupata pono lya mabenelo ago. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Ikiva nefwe tuvyalile mbeyu lya Kimuhe munumbula chenu wuli, setung'ang'wa kupata finu fya kututanga mukwikala uku.? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Ngita nyenye mwikwidikila kuvagavila vangi finu fya kuvatanga kwikala, ndakyene ata nefwe mwing'ang'wa kwidikila kutugavila finu fya kututanga kwikala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Ila nefwe setukuvaswitilicha fila finu fyemung'ang'wa kutugavila fya kwikala, ila tuhuvilila mukila kinu, neke tubihile kuvakanila vanu kudalika Njowo nofu cha Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Wuli, semchela kuva yeikumbanikila mukaye lya Nguluvi, vilya kyakulya kuhuma mukaye ilyo? Wuli, vala vevigita kasi mukindangavala kya kuhechela usembe, viwanuka pono lya usembe yeihechwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Mtwa akalagiche ndeni, vevidalika Njowo Nofu vapate kyakulya kyao kuhumana na kasi ilyo.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ila nene sendikasakile kinu ata kidodo. Na vala sendisimba neke nene ndigavilwe finu ifyo, kwa nene ngiba kufuwa kuliko kumgita munu yeyonda anikane kwinjuma kuva ndidalika Njowo nofu ngajila kuhombwa. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ila pendidalika Njowo Nofu sendiwesa kwinjuma kwakuva ndi kasi lyangu lya kudalika. Dandikiwona, ngasendidalika Njowo Nofu! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Ngita ngandihaguwe yune kasi iyi, suwe, ngandihuvilila kuhombwa, ila nondee nding'ang'wa kuigita, kwakuva Nguluvi yeanigavile ndiigite. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Nondee kuhombwa kwa nene ndi kinu liki? Mahombo gyangu nde aga, kudalika Njowo Nofu ngajila kuhombwa, ngajila kusuka mahombo gyeging'ang'wa kuhombwa kwajili lya kudalika Njowo Nofu.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Ndeni, nene se msutu va munu yeyonda, ndigehe pekesu. Ila kwakuva lya kuvatanga vanu vangi vamudikile Kilisito, ndiyivikile kuva msutu va vanu vonda. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Kwa vayawudi ndikali ngita Myahudi neke nivatange neke ndivatange vala vevifwata lulagilicho lwa Musa vamudikiye Kilisito, kwakuva nene sendigehe panyi lya lugilicho lwa Musa, ila ndikayivikile panyi lya lulagilicho kwa vawo neke ndivapate vevagehe panyi lya lulagilicho. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Na kwa vala vevihela lulagilicho lwa Musa, ndikali ngita ndihela lulagilicho ulo, ila se ngita ndihela lulagilicho pautalo lya Nguluvi, ila ndilongochwa na lulagilicho lwa Kilisito neke ndivatange vala vevihela lulagilicho vamudikile Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Kwa vala vevagehe vasosovafu muludikilo, ndikayidikile kuva msosovafu ngita vene neke ndivatange avo vasosovafu muludikilo. Ndikagitile kila kinu kwa vonda neke ndiwese kuvalowa vamonga vawo.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Ndigita aga gyonda kwakuva lya Njowo Nofu cha Nguluvi, neke ndiwese kuwanuka lufunyo chake pamwi na vangi. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Wuli, se mwichela kuva mumkino va kunyila, vonda vinyila ila yeiwanuka fupo agehe yumwi hela? Ndeni ndeni na nyenye munyile hilo neke muwese kuwanuka fupo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Vanyila vakwikanila kwa kila kinu, suwe vawo vigita ndeni neke vawanuke fupo yeyihanangika, Ila nefwe twikanila neke tuwese kuwanuka fupo yeseyihanangika. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Ata nene sendinyila ngita munu yeihela natilo, kangi senditovana ngita munu yeitova ngajila natilo. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Ila ndikuugita muvili vangu uhuvilile kwa kuugudisa na kuwuchovelecha neke pendimalila kuvadalikila vanu vangi Njowo Nofu, ndibihile kukanwa pautalo lwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Kulakalila kutiya ling'omongomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Vakolo vangu ndisaka muwiwuke kuva vala vagogolo vetu vonda yevalongochwe na Musa vevagubikwe na lifunde lya inyanza, vakahagime muinyanza. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Pevalongochwe na lifunde na kuchumba pagatigati lya inyanza, vonda vakali vabatisilwe vakavechile vanu va Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Vonda vakaliye kyakulya kila kila kyekikahumile kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />na vonda vakanyuwe gala malenga gya kimuhe, kwakuva vakanyuwe kuhuma muliganga, liganga ilyo nde Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Ila volofu vamonga vawo sevakumkelesa Nguluvi na Nguluvi akavadochile na mafimba gyawo chikalutala kukwelu.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Suwe, makani ago ndi mufanu kwa nefwe, neke gatulakilele tubihile kudobokela uhofu ngita pevagitile vawo. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Mubihile kufunya ming'omong'omo ngita vamonga vawo pevakali, ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, “Vanu vakaliye na kunyuwa, vakaimile na kukina kwa nyoni.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Tubihile kugona ngita pevagitile vamonga vawo, mbaka vakafuwe vanu elufu isilini na chidatu kwa kigono kimwi. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Tubihile kumgecha Mtwa ngita pevakamgechile vamonga vawo na vakalumile na lyoka na va kafuwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Mubihile kung'ong'oleka ngita vamonga vawo pevakang'ong'oleka, navo vakadochilwe na mdocha.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Suwe makani aga gevapatile nde mufanu kwa vanu vangi, gakasimbilwe neke kutukalila nefwe vetwikwikala figono ifi fya mwiso.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Yeikwihocha imile unofu muludikilo, ayilolele neke abihile kuguwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Magecho gyemunagyo nde galagala gyevanagyo vanu vonda. Ila Nguluvi ndi mndakyene va kila lukani, mwene dasekuvaleka mugechwe hilo. Pemugechwa, Nguluvi akuvagavila ludali lwa kuhuvilila na ng'asi lya kuhega.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Ndeni, vakolo vangu, mubihile kukumbanikila ming'mong'omo. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Ndiywanga na nyenye vanu vene luhala, muhoche unofu aga gyendilonga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Petukumuhongecha Nguluvi kwa kikombe kila kya lufunyo, kya kuwanganiswa na usembe lya danda lya Kilisito na libubunda lila lyetuketula, wuli, natilo lyake sekwiwunga na muvili va Kilisito? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Kwakuva libumunda ndi limwi, ila nefwe tugehe vongofu, ila ndi muvili umwi, kwakuva twevonda tuliya libumunda ulo.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Muvalolele avo Vaisilaleli veviliya usembe mukaye lya Nguluvi, wuli, sevawunganiswe na kindangavala kya maganga kya kuhechela litambiko? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Kyendisaka kulonga ndi iki, wuli, kyakula kyekitambikilwe ming'omong'omo ndi kinu? Awu na ago ming'omong'omo ndi kinu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Ata ludodo! Kyendilonga ndikuva usembe vevihecha vanu sevamchele Nguluvi vakuvahechela mahoka, vala se Nguluvi. Ndakyene sendikela nyenye muwungine na mahoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Semwing'ang'wa kunywela kikombe kya Mtwa na kikombe kya mahoka, semung'ang'wa kuliya pamesa lya Mtwa na pamesa lya mahoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Wuli, mwing'ang'a kumvipisa Mtwa? Wuli, tugehe na ludali hilo kuchumba mwene?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Vanu vangi mugati lyenu vilonga, finu fyonda fidikilwe, ila sefyonda fitanga, ila nene ndilonga ata ngita finu fyonda fidikilwe, ila se finu fyonda fitanga kuchenga ludikilo. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Munu yeyonda abihile kusaka njowo chechikumutanga yumwe, ila uvatange vanu vangi.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Muliye kyekyonda kyekiguchwa musoko ngajila kuhucha wucha neke mubihile kugunika munumbula chenu, <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />kwakuva isimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, “Inyi na fyonda fyefigehe ndi fya Mtwa.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ngita munu yesemuidikila Kilisito, akuvalalika muhelele kuliya na nyenye mwisaka kuhelela, suwe, muliye fyonda fyeavavikile ngajila kuwucha wucha neke mubihile kwilata munumbula chenu. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Ila munu akivalongela. “Kyakula iki kihechilwe muming'omong'omo,” Suwe, mubihile kuliya, kwakuva lya munu uyo yeavalongile abihile kwilata munumbula lyake na nyenye mubihile kwilata munumbula chenu. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Ndilonga aga, kwakuva lya kwilataka munumbula, ila se malato genu nyenye, ila ndi malato kwa yula yeavalongiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Damukunihucha, “Wuli, kwilata kwa munu yungi gakuniswitilicha nene kinu kya kugita? Ndiwesa kugita kyendikela. <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi kabula lya kuliya kyakula, ngita ndigita ndeni, kwa liki, ndiwoneka ndigita nongwa?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Suwe, kinu kyekyonda kyemugita iveche kulya awu kunyuwa, mugite gyonda kwa kumkelesa Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Mubihile kuvagita vanu vangi vagite mahofu kwa Vayawudi awu kwa vanu se Vayawudi awu kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Muveche ngita nene, ndigecha kuvagitila vanu vonda manofu, ila sekwakuva lya kwitanga yumwene, ila kwakuva lya kuvatanga vanu vangi neke vaweswe kulowoliwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Munifwate nene ngita nene pendikumufwata Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugubika mutuwe chipindi kya kufunya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Vakolo vangu, ndikuvanjuma kwakuva mukundiwuka na mukolela mawulanicho gendivawulaniche nyenye. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ila ndisaka muchele kuva Kilisito nde mutuwe va kila mgosi na mgosi nde mutuwe va mdala vake na Nguluvi nde mutuwe va Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Suwe, kila mgosi yeifunya na yeilanducha unanzi va Nguluvi kuno agubike mutuwe vake, uyo akumgavila nyoni Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Na mdala yeifunya awu kulanducha unanzi va Nguluvi ngajila kugubika mutuwe vake, akumgavila nyoni mgosi vake, uyo yeigita ndeni iwana na mdala yeimoga fwili chake. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Mdala yeseigubika mutuwe vake, ngiba amoge fwili chake. Ila nde nyoni kwa mdala kumoga fwili chake, suwe ngiba agubike kituwe kyake. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Se ngiba mgosi kugubika mutuwe vake, kwakuva mwene ndi mufanu na mkomi va Nguluvi. Ila mdala iwonesa akumginya mgosi vake. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Mgosi seakawumbilwe kuhuma kwa mdala, ila mdala akahumbilwe kuhuma kwa mgosi. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Mgosi seakawumbilwe kwakuva lya mdala, ila mdala akawumbilwe kwakuva lya mgosi. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ndeni, mdala igubika mutuwe vake, iveche kimanyilo lya umwimike pakyanya lyake na kwakuva lya ndumindumi va kuluhano. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ila kwa kwiwunga na Mtwa, mdala akumuhuvilela mgosi na mgosi akumuhuvila mdala. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Ngita ndeni mdala kahumile kwa mgosi, ndeni ndeni mgosi ibabwa na mdala. Ila kila kinu kihuma kwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Muswitiliche mwavene, wuli, ndingiba kwa mdala kumsuka Nguluvi ngajila kugubika mutuwe vake? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Wuli, mawumbile gya asili segiwonesa wachi kuva mgosi kuvecha na fwili chitali ndi nyoni kwa mwene? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Ila kwa mdala kuvecha na fwili chitali, ndi uginyange kwa mwene. Kwakuva agavilwe fwili chitali neke, chimugubike. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ngita munu yeyonda yeisaka kupinja lukani ulu, nefwe twihela mawulanicho ngita ago, vala lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito, lihela mawulanichi ngita ago.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyakula kya Mtwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matayo 26.26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maliko 14.22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22.14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Pendave kuvagavila malagilicho aga, sendikuvanjuma, kwakuva pemwikwilundasa semugita makani manofu, ila mugita makani manjanganifu. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Tandi, ndipulike pemwitang'ana mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikile Kilisito, mukwinenga, ila muago gendipulike gangi ndi ga undakyene. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Kwa undakyene damwinenga pagati lyenu neke vala vevagehe va Nguluvi vachelwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Ndakyene, pemwitang'ana pamwi, se muliya kyakula kya Mtwa ngita peing'ang'wa! <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Kwakuva pemwilia kila yumwi iliya ngajila kuvagavila vangi. Ndeni, vamonga venu vana njala na vangi vagalile. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Wuli, semwiwesa kulya na kunyuwa pakaye lyenu! Awu mukulibeda lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito na kuvagudisa avo sevihela kinu? Mwisaka, ndivalongile liki? Ndivanjume? Hamu, sendikuvanjuma kwa makani ago.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Kwakuva, ndikawanuke kuhuma kwa Mtwa mawulanicho gyendivagavile nyenye, Mtwa Yesu pamiye wuwula, peyave Yesu kubatwa, akautegula libumunda, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />akamsuka Nguluvi, peamalile kumusuka, akaudumule, akilonga, “Ugu ndi muvili vangu kwakuva lyenu, mugite ndeni kwa kundiwiwuka nene.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Ndeni ndeni akanyamuwe kikombe kya difwayi, akilonga, “Iki ndi kikombe kya lyagano limiya yeiwoneswa kwa danda lyangu. Mugite ndeni, kila pemunyuwa kwa kundiwiwuka nene.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Kwakuva kila pemuliya libumunda ugu na kunywela kikombe ikyo, mwilanducha kufuwa kwa Mtwa, mbaka daiwuya. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Ndeni, kila munu yealiya libumunda ilyo awu kunywela kikombe ikyo kya Mtwa kwa ng'asi yeing'ang'wa, daavecha agitile sambi kwakuva abedile muvili na danda lya Mtwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Suwe, kila munu ayilolele yumwene, pambele nde ang'ang'wa kuliya libumunda na kunywela kikombe ikyo. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Kwakuva yeilya na kunywela ngajila kuchela muvili va Mtwa ndi kinu liki, alya na kunywela lihigo lwake yumwene. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Kuhumana na ilyo mugati lyenu, vagehe vatamwa na vasosovafu vangi vafuwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Ila ngita ngatuyilolele vavene ngatuhigilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ila petwihigwa na Mtwa, twiwulanichwa tuveche vasanzi na tubihile kuhingwa pamwi na vanu se vakumchela Nguluvi.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Nondee, vakolo vangu, pemwitang'ana kulya kyakulya kya Mtwa, kila yumwi amchinde mweyage na mukwibuse kwa lukelo. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Na ngita kugehe na munu yeyonda yeagehe na njala, aliye kukaye lyake, neke pemutang'ana mubihile kuhigwa na Nguluvi. Na gangi gegisigaliye, dandilonga pendikwacha.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Fupo kuhuma kwa Muhe va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Suwe, vakolo vangu, ndisaka muchele unofu makani gya fupo kuhuma kwa Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Muchela kuva pemukali mwave kumudikila Kilisito, mukalongochwe kugundamila ming'omong'omo chechihela uwumi. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Suwe, muchele kuva munu yoyonda yeilongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi seivesa kulonga. “Yesu akotolwe!” Ndeni ndeni munu yeyonda seivesa kulonga “Yesu nde Mtwa,” Nga sealongochwe na Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Suwe, kugehe na fupo cha ayina cholofu na yeakuvagila vanu fupo icho ndi Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Ila kugehe na ng'asi chongofu cha kumgundamikila, ila Mtwa ndi yumwi. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Kangi, kugehe na ng'asi chongofu, ila Nguluvi yuyula yeagita kasi chonda kwa vanu vonda. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Muhe va Nguluvi akumtanga kila munu kugita kasi lyake neke vanu vangi vapate lutango. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Kwakuva Muhe va Nguluvi umgavila munu yumwi unanzi va uginyange na yungi unanzi va luchelo, ngita peikela yumwene. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Muhe va Nguluvi yuyula akumgavila munu yungi fupo lwa ludikilo na yungi fupo lwa kuvecha na umwimike lwa kunanicha. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Muhe va Nguluvi yula yula akumgavila munu yungi umwimike va kugita umanyitu na yungi fupo lwa uvichi va Nguluvi, yungi akumgavila umwimike va kuchela fupo lwa Muhe va Nguluvi. Vangi fupo lwa kulonga ng'ombelu chingi na yungi fupo lwa kuganula ng'ombelo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Ago gonda ndi kasi cha Muhe yuyula va Nguluvi yumwi, yeakumgavila kila munu ngita peikela yumwene.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvili umwi ila ugehe na fiwungo fyongofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Muvili va munu yumwi ugehe na fiwungo fyolofu, fiwungo ifyo ndi fya muvili wumwi, nde igehe ndeni kwa muvili va Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Kwakuva nefwe vonda ndi Vayawudi awu vanu se Vayawudi awu vasutu awu vanu vapekesu, vonda tubatiswe na Muhe yumwi na kugavilwa Muhe umwi neke tuveche muvili umwi.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Ila muvili sekiwungo kimwi hela, ila ugehe na fiwungo fyolofu. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ngita ligulu lilonga, “Kwakuva nene seliwoko nene sepono lya muvili,” Wuli, kwakuva lya ilyo ligulu sepono lya muvili? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Ngita lisigicha ngalilongile, “Kwakuva nene seliho, nene sepono lya muvili,” Wuli, kwakuva lya ilyo lisigicha sepono lya muvili? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Ngita muvili vonda ngauvechile liho, munu ngaapulike wuli? Ngita muvili vonda ngaugehe lisigicha munu ngaanusile wuli? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Ila Nguluvi avikile fiwungo mumvili, kila kimwi ngita peakeliye yumwene. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ngita fiwungo fyonda ngauvechile kiwungo kimwi, muvili ngaugehe kwiya? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Undakyene ndi kuva, fiwungo fya muvili ndi fyongofu, ila muvili ndi umwi.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Suwe, liho selivesa kulilongela liwoko, “Sendikukela” Vala kituwe sekivesa kugalongela magulu, “Sendikuvakela nyenye.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Kuchumba ago fiwungo fya muvili fyefiwoneka kuva nde visosovafu fyefyitakilwa hilo. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Kangi, fila fiwungo fyefiwoneka fya kubedwa ifyo nde tukufigavila uginyange, ila fiwungo fya muvili fyefiwoneka fileta nyoni nde tukufigubika unofu. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Ila fiwungo sefileta nyoni sefing'ang'wa kugubikwa ngita fiwungo fingi. Ila Nguluvi yumwene awuvikile unofu fiwungo mumvili na akafigavile uginyange hilo fila fiwungo fyefibedilwe, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />ndena kubihile kuvecha na kwinenga mumvili, fiwungo fyonda fitangane pamwi. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Ngita kiwungo kimwi kilemela fiwungo fyonda filemala pamwi na kila kyekilemala. Kiwungo kimwi kikinjumwa fiwungo fyonda fikeduka pamwi na chene.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Suwe, nyenye vonda ndi muvili va Kilisito, kila yumwi venu ndi kiwungo kya muvili ugo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito, Nguluvi avikile vakwanja vanjagila na vangi vavichi va Nguluvi kangi vawulanichi, baho avikile vala vene fupo lya kunanicha na kutanga na vilongochi na vevilonga ng'ombelo cha ugenji. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Vonda sevanjagila na vonda sevavichi va Nguluvi na vonda sevawulanichi na vonda sevene fupo lya kugita umanyitu. <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Vonda nde vana fupo lya kunanicha, vonda ndi vene fupo lya kulonga ng'ombelo lya ugenji, vonda viganula ng'ombelo <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Ndena, muveche na ludoboko lwa kuwanuka fupo chechigehe nofu hilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Nene ndikuvawonesa ng'asi nofu ngita petuichumbile nefwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Lukelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ndiwesa kuvecha na umwimike va kulonga ng'ombelo chongofu cha vanu na ata cha vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, ila ngita ndihela lukelo, ndiwana na lichwi lya lidebe lyelihela kinu na kyowo cha ngengele. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Ndeni ndeni, ngandivecha na umwimike va kupulika na kulonga unanzi kuhuma kwa Nguluvi na ndeni ndeni ngandicheliye lupwepo londa lwa Nguluvi na kuchela makani gyonda, kangi ngandivechile na ludikilo lukomi lwa kuhecha fidunda, ila ngita ndihela lukelo nene sekinu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Kangi, ngandihecha finu fyangu fyonda kuvagavila vahangala na kuhecha muvili vangu unyanywe lyoto, ngita ndihela lukelo, seitanga kinu.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Munya lukelo uhuvilila na itanga vangi na munya lukelo ihela wifu na seakwidumba vala seihela kidada. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Munya lukelo akuvaginya vangi na seigita kuhocha makani gyake na munya lukelo seikumgita munu avipe kisatu na munya lukelo seiwuwika mahofu. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Munya lukelo seikedukila magito mahofu, ila akedukila magito ga undakyene. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Munu munya lukelo seidenyeka numbula na seileka kudikila na ihendelela kuhuvilila gyonda na seileka kuhuvilila.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Munu munya lukelo figono fyonda ihendelela kuwonesa lukelo. Ila fupo fingi figehe na mwiso vake, ngita fila umwimike va kupulika na kulonga unanzi va Nguuvi na kunywanga ng'ombelo miya na luhala, fyonda dafichumba. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Kwakuva kwa chipindi ichi tuchela makani madodo hela kuhuma kwa Nguluvi na tuwesa kulanducha makani madodo gegitugachela kuhuma kwa Nguluvi! <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Ila kyekikamilike pekikwacha, fila fyonda sefikamile dafivecha sekinu.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Pendikali mwana ndikaywangile ngita mwana, ndachelige ngita mwana, ndahochile ngita mwana, pendikulile ndikalekile makani gya uwana. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Ila nondee tukwilola ngita petukwilola mulindala, ila pambele datukwilola unofu hilo. Nondee, ndichela hela ludodo, ila pambele dandichela gyonda ngita Nguluvi peakundichela nene.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Ndena, makani aga gadatu gakwikala mbepali, ludikilo na luhuvililo na lukelo na mugati gya ago leligehe likomi hilo ndi lukelo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Fupo fingi cha Muhe va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Mugangamale muveche na lukelo. Ndeni ndeni mwigangamale kuvecha na fupo fingi cha Muhe va Nguluvi. Hilo fupo lya kulandula unanzi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Munya kulonga ng'ombelo lya ugenji seilonga na munu, ila ilonga na Nguluvi kwakuva kuhela munu yeichela. Mwene, ilonga kwa ludali lwa Muhe va Nguluvi finu fyefifyahamile. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Ila munya fupo lya kulandula unanzi va Nguluvi, ilonga na vanu njowo cha kuvagangacha muludikilo na kuvakolela mawoko. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Munya kulonga ng'ombelo lya ugenji akwikangamacha yumwene. Ila munya kulanducha unanzi va Nguluvi, akulikangamicha lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Suwe, na nene ndikela nyenye vonda mulonge kwa ng'ombelo lya ugenji, ila ngandikeliye hilo nyenye mulanduche unanzi va Nguluvi. Kwakuva munu yeilanducha unanzi va Nguluvi ndi ngiba hilo kuchumba yula munya kulonga ng'ombelo cha ugenji, ila ngakoyuli munu yeiwesa kuganula gala makani gyegilongwa, neke lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito vawese kutangwa na kugangamala muludikilo. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Nondee, vakolo vangu ngita ndikwacha kwa nyenye na kulonga kwa ng'ombelo lya ugenji, wuli, ikuvatanga liki? Daseikuvatanga kyokyonda. Ila ngandikuvalongela gala Nguluvi anigubutuliye neke mugachele na kuvawulanicha luchowo lwa Nguluvi, baho dandivecha ndivatangile.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Nde peigehe mufinu fyefihela uwumi pefihumicha lichwi ngita fila mululi awu ligombo. Munu daichela wuli lusambo lweutovwa ngita finu ifyo sevihumicha lichwi ngita peing'ang'wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Ngita lingalapi pelivemba ngajila kulonga lichwi lyake selichelwa unofu, ani daakwivika unofu kwa fita? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Ngita mwilonga njowo sechichelwa nde ani daichela chechilongwa? <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Chigehe ng'ombelo cholofu muinyi, kwihela ata imwi yeseihela mana. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Ila nene ngita sendichela ng'ombelo yeiywanga munu tunga, nene nde mgenji kwa mwene na mwene nde mgenji kwa nene. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Ndeni ndeni na nyenye mugehe na ng'elu lya kwanuka fupo lya Muhe va Nguluvi, mwigangamale hilo kwipatila fupo lwa Muhe fyefitanga kulichenga lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Kwakuva munya kulonga ng'ombelo lya ugenji amusuke Nguluvi neke aveche kuganula kila kyeilonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Kwakuva pendisuka kwa Nguluvi kwa ng'ombelo lya ugenji muhe va nene nde usuka kwa Nguluvi, ila luhala lwangu selugita kinu kyokyonda. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nondee ndigite liki? Dandifunya kwa muhe va nene na kangi dandifunya kwa luhala lwangu, dandisomola kwa muhe vangu na kangi dandisomola kwa luhala lwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Ngita ukumjuma Nguluvi kwa muhe hela, munu yungi yeseichela ng'ombelo yeuywanga, ivesa wuli kulonga, “Ena” ngita seichela kyeulonga?<verse eid="1CO 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Lusuko lwako lwa kumuhongecha Nguluvi ivesa ndakyene hilo, ila uyo yungi daseikumtanga kinu muludikilo.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Ndukumuhongecha Nguluvi kuva nene ndilonga kwa ng'ombelo miya kuchumba nyevonda. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Ila mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito ndikela hilo kulonga makani mahanu kwa luhala lwangu, neke ndivawulaniche na vangi kuliko kulonga makani elufu kyumi gya ng'ombelo cha ugenji.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Vakolo vangu, mubihile kuhocha ngita fyali, ila muveche muhocha ngita vanu vakomi, ila munjow cha sambi muveche ngita fyali. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Mumasimbo ga Nguluvi isimbilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Dandilonga na vanu ava kuchumbila vagenji vautali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">vevilonga ng'ombelo lya ugenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">ata ndeni dasevakundipulikicha.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Suwe, fupo lya kulonga ng'ombelo lya ugenji sekimanyilo kya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito, ila kwa vala vanu sevamudikiye Kilisito. Ila fupo lya umwimike va kupulika na kulonga unanzi va Nguluvi ndi kwa vala vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito na sekwa vala sevamudikiye Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Suwe, lipinga lyonda lyelimudikiye Kilisito pelitang'ana pamwi na vonda kuvanga kulonga ng'ombelo genji, leke vikwacha vanu sevamudikiye Kilisito. Wuli, sevilonga kuva nyenye nde muna lukwale? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Ila vonda vakiva vilandula unanzi va Nguluvi, baho, ngaikwacha munu yeseamudikiye Kilisito awu munu mpufi, ila gyonda daipulike, dagikumuwonesa kuva agitile sambi, kangi daileka kugita sambi, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />na njowo cha lupwepo munumbula chake dachiwoneka na dafugamila na kumgundamila Nguluvi, kuno akilonga, “Ndakyene Nguluvi agehe pamwi na nyenye.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufunye unofu mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Vakolo vangu, ndigehe na mana iyi, pemwitang'ana, yumwi isomola msambo na yungi awulaniche na yungi aveche ipulika na kulonga unanzi va Nguluvi na yungi aveche kulonga kwa ng'ombelo lya ugenji na yungi avaganulile. Gyonda gaveche kwakuva lya kumgita kila yumwi venu akule muludikilo. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ngakogali vanu vakulonga ng'ombelo cha ugenji, valonge vavili awu vadatu, sekugina hilo, kangi yumwi yumwi na aveche munu va kuganula ago gegilongwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Ila nga kwihela yeivesa kuganula, suwe mubihile kulonga ng'ombelo lya ugenji pemutang'anila, ayilongele yumwene na Nguluvi vake. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Kutigala vala vene fupo lya kulanducha unanzi va Nguluvi, valonge vavili awu vadatu na vangi vevapulikiche kwa undakyene njowo chawo. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Ila ngita munu yumwi peilonga na yungi yeipulikicha apatile ugubutulo kuhuma kwa Nguluvi, suwe yula yeilonga achike. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Kwakuva nyenye vonda mwiwesa kulanducha unanzi va Nguluvi yungi, neke nyenye vonda muveche kwiwulanicha na kwigangamacha. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Fupo lya kulanducha unanzi va Nguluvi ing'ang'wa kulongochwa na yula munya fupo. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Kwakuva Nguluvi se Nguluvi va ndewo, ila ndi Nguluvi va lutengamaso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Ngita peigehe mumapinga gyonda ga vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />vadala vachike mumtang'ano va vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito. Seving'ang'wa kulonga, ila ving'ang'wa kwidikila ngita Nguluvi peilonga mulagilicho gake. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Nga vagehe na mahucho gya kuhucha, vavahuche vagosi vawo kukaye, kwakuva nde nyoni kwa mudala kuywanga mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Wuli, mwihocha lichwi lya Nguluvi lihumile kwa nyenye awu lyachile kwa nyenye hela? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Ngita munu yeyonda ihocha kuva mwene ndi mnanzi va Nguluvi awu agehe na fupo lya Muhe va Nguluvi, achele kuva aga ndi ndivasimbiliye nyenye ndi lulagilicho kuhuma kwa Mtwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Ila munu yeagehe mpufi mumakani ago na aveche mpufi.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Ndeni, vakolo vangu mwing'ang'wa kuvecha na ng'elu lya kulanducha unanzi va Ngulivi. Ila mubihile kumukanicha munu kulonga kwa ng'ombelo lya ugenji. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ila gyonda gagitwe kwa unofu na ngita peing'ang'wa.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Uchulubuko va Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Nondee, vakolo vangu, ndikela kuvawuwisa Njowo Nofu yendivadalikiye nyenye na mukawanuke na iyo nde ikuvagita mukwime ukangafu. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Ngita mukugafwata makani gendikuvalongela, damulowolilwa, ngita mubihile kugafwata suwe, kwidikila kwa nyenye ndi sekinu.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Nene ndikavagavile nyenye makani manofu hilo, ambago nene ndikagawanuke. Kuva Kilisito akafuwe kwakuva lya sambi chetu ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />na akasililwe, akachulubuka kigono kya udatu ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />kuva akambwitukila Peteli na pambele akavabwitukila vala vanjagila kumi na vavili. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Kangi, akavahumiye vanu miya chihanu, volofu vawo vave wumi, ila vamonga vawo vafuwe suwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Pambele akambwitukiye Yakobo kangi akavabwitukiye vanjagila vonda.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Mwiso va gyonda, akandibwitukila nene, nene ndikali ngita mwana yeababilwe chipindi sechake. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Kwakuva nene ndi mdodo hilo mugati lya vanjagila vonda, sending'ang'wa kukemelwa mnjagila, kwakuva ndikaligudile lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Ila kwa usanzi va Nguluvi geunigitile ndiveche ndeni, usanzi vake kwa nene seukali va hela. Nene ndigitile kasi kuchumba vonda, ila senene, ila ndi usanzi va Nguluvi yeugitile kasi pamwi na nene. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Ndeni, ndiveche nene awu vaveche vala vanjagila vangi, vonda tudalika njowo chila chila chemudikiye.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuchulubuka kwa nefwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Kilisito ilanduchwa kuva achulubuke, wuli, vamonga venu vilonga kuva kwihela kuchulubuka? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Nga kwihela kuchulubuka, suwe, Kilisito seakachulubuka, <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />ngita Kilisito seachulubuke, suwe, madaliko gyetu na kudikila kwa nefwe kwihela mana. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Kangi nefwe ngatuwoneke vaswida va udesi, kwakuva tukalongile kuva Nguluvi akamchulubucha Kilisito, ila ngita vanu sevachulubuchwa, suwe, Nguluvi seakamchulubuche Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Ngita vanu vevafuwe sevichulubuka, suwe, Kilisito nave seachulubuchwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Na ngita Kilisito seachulubushwe, suwe ludikilo venu ndi va hela, musigala musambi chenu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Ndeni ndeni vala vonda vevafuwe kuno vamudikiye Kilisito, vayagile tipu. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ikiva luhuvililo lwetu kwa Kilisito ndi uwumi va nondee hela, Suwe, nefwe ndi vanu va kuwonelwa lusungu muinyi.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Ila undakyene ndi ugu, Kilisito achulubiwe kuhuma kwa vanu vevafuwe, mwene akali vakwanja kwa vala vevafuwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Kwakuva kufuwa kuletilwe na munu yumwi, ndeni ndeni na kuchulubuchwa kukaletilwe na munu yumwi. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Kwakuva vonda twifuwa kwakuva tuhumile kwa Adamu. Ndeni ndeni vonda davachulubuchwa kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ila kila yumwi daichulubuchwa kwa fwatatila ng'asi iyi, kwanja ivanga Kilisito, pambele daiwuya vala vevagehe vake davachulubuchwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Pegichumba ago, na mwiso peukwacha, Kilisito daakumgavila Daada Nguluvi Ung'achale, baho daakuvahananga vatavala vonda na vene umwimike vonda na vene ludali vonda. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kwakuva ikumng'ang'a Kilisito atavale mbaka avasinde vachwindama vake vonda na kuvatavala. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Mchundamwa va mwiso kuhanangwa ndi kufuwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo, “Nguluvi avikile kila kinu muumwimike vake.” Ila, masimbo pegilonga, “Finu fyonda fivikilwe panyi lya umwimike vake na atavale” Yiwoneka kuva Nguluvi seagehe panyi lya Kilisito, kwakuva Nguluvi yumwene nde avikile finu ifyo fyonda panyi lya Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Baho finu fyonda dafivikilwa panyi lya mwana vake, baho Mwana dakuyivika panyi lya muumwimike va Nguluvi, yeavikile finu fyonda panyi lya Mwana vake, neke Nguluvi aveche mtavala va finu fyonda.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Ngita kwihela uchulubucho, vigita wuli vala vevibatiswa kwakuva lya vanu vevafuwe vakuhuvilila liki? Ngita vanu vevafuwe sevichulubuchwa, wuli, kubatiswa kwakuva lya vene? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Wuli, na nefwe twikwivika muluchango lwa kufuwa? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Vakolo vangu, nene ndigehe muluchago lwa kufuwa kila kigono! Ndikwidumbila kwakuva nyenye nde lipinga lya vanu vemumudikiye Kilisito Yesu Mtwa vetu, ndeikunigita ndilanduche makani aga. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Ngita luhuvilila lwangu ngalifechile lwa muinyi ugu, kutovana kwa nene na vanu ngita vang'oko vang'ali muumwani ugu va Ifeso, nganitangile liki? Ngita Nguluvi dakuvachulubucha, “Ndingiba kuliya na kunyuwa hela, kwakuva kilawu datufuwa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Mubihile kuchangwa na vanu vevilonga ndeni kwakuva, “Vaganja vanjanganifu vihananga kyanda nofu.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Mulamwike nondee! Muleke kwendelela kugita sambi. Vamonga venu sevakumchela Nguluvi ng'odo. Ndikuvalongela aga, neke mulole soni!<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvili va uchulubuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Ila munu ivesa kuhucha, “Vanu vevafuwe vichulubuchwa wuli? Davivecha na muvili va namuna liki?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Ago ndi mahucho gya upufi! Mbeyu yeivyalwa seimela mbaka ifuwe tandi. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Mbeyu yewivyala nde mbeyu hela, ivecha lya upemba awu yingi yeyonda, ila peimela ivecha na mvili wungi. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ila Nguluvi akuigavila icho mbeyu mvili ngita peikela na kila mbeyu mvili vake.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Ndeni ndeni mivili gya fiwumbe fyonde sefiwana. Vanu vana muvili gwao na vang'oko vagehe na muvili gwao na fidege figehe na muvili gwao na somba vagehe na muvili gwao ndeni.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Kangi kugehe na mivili gya kuluwano na mivili gya muinyi, ila unofu va gila mivili gya kuluhano nde gaayina imwi na unofu va gila mivili gya muinyi nde gyaayina yingi. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Lichuwa lig'alika kwa unofu vake na mwechi ung'alika kwa namuna yingi na nondwa chig'alika kwa namuna yingi, ata nondwa sechikuwana kwa kung'alika kwake.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ndeni ndepeivecha vanu davichulubuchwa. Ngita fila mbeyu, mvili usilwa mumganga na kuwola na dauchulubuchwa daseuwola. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Muvili peusilwa uhela uginyange na uhela ludali. Ila dauchulubuchwa uvecha unofu na vene ludali. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Muvili peusilwa, usilwa mumvili va munu, ila peuchulubuchwa uvecha muvili va kimuhe. Ugehe muvili va munu na kugehe muvili va kimuhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Kwakuva isimbilwe mumasimbo, “Munu va kwanja yeakemilwe Adamu, akali kiwumbe kene wumi,” Ila Adamu vamwiso ndi Yesu mwene nde Muhe yeakuvagavila vanu wumi. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Ila muvili veulonguwe ndi muvili va huchi, pambele ukwacha muvili miya vetugavilwe na Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Adamu va kwanja akawumbilwe kwa mganga, Kilisito va pili akahumile kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Vanu vonda va muinyi vagehe na mivili ngita Adamu yeuhumile mumganga na vala vevigehe kuluhanao vagehe ngita yula yeahumile kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, yende Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Ngita fila tuwanine na yula yeawumbilwe na mganga, mwene ndi Adamu na yula yeahumile kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, mwene ndi Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Suwe, vakolo vangu ndilonga ndeni. Kila kyekigitilwe kwa muvili na danda sekivesa kwingila Mung'achale va Nguluvi. Na kyekihanganika sekiwesa kuwanuka kwanangika.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Mupulikiche, ndikuvalongela lupwepo. Nefwe setwifuwa vonda ila vonda twigalambuswa, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />Chipindi cha lingalapi lya mwiso pelilanduchwa, baho baho ngita kudinda na kudindula meho, vanu vichulubuchwa na mivili segihanangika na nefwe datwigalambuliwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Kwakuva mivili gyetu igi gyegihanangika ging'ang'wa igalambuchwe kuvecha mivili segihanangika, mivili gyegifuwa giveche mivili segifuwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Ndeni, mvili ugu veuhanangika ngaugalambuka kuvecha mvili seuhanangika na kila kikifuwa pekigalambuka kiveche sekifuwa, baho nde undakyene peutimila ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo, “Nguluvi ahanangile kufuwa na kufuwa kihanangike hilo!” <verse eid="1CO 15:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Veve ludali chako cha kuletela ung'ali chigehe kwiya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Veve kufuwa umwimike vako va kulemacha ugehe kwiya?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Sambi chileta ung'ali va kufuwa na ludali lwa sambi chiwoneka kuchumbila malagilicho cha Nguluvi cheamgavile Musa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Ila tumuhongeche Nguluvi yeatugavila nefwe usindi kwa kuchumbila Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Suwe, vakolo vangu mwime kwa ukangafu, mubihile kugalambushwa na kinu kyokyonda. Figono fyonda mwendelele kugita kasi cha Mtwa kwakuva muchela kasi yemukumgumbanikila Mtwa daseiyaga hela.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Kuvagavila vanu va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Nondee, kutigila kuvagavila sendi vanu va Nguluvi vevagehe ku Yelusalemu, mugite ngita pendivalagiliche lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito va ukoya ku Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Kila kigono kya kutulula kila yumwi avike pono lya sendi chake cheapatile, neke pendikwacha kubihile kulundaswa kangi sendi. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Pendikwacha kwa nyenye ndikuvalagicha vala dandikuvahagula mugati lyenu vasindike baluwa na fupo chenu mumwani va ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Ngita daing'ang'wa na nene kuhelela na nyenye ukoya, datwihelela pamwi.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahocho gya Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Pendivecha ndihelela ku Makedoniya, dandichumbila kwa nyenye kwakuva ndisaka kuhelela ku Mekodoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Pendikwacha dandikala kwa nyeye kwa chipindi kidodo, chipindi chonda cha ng'ala, neke muwese kunitanga kuendelela na lugendo lwangu poponda pendihelela. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Sendikela kuchumba kwa nyenye kisatu na kwendelela na lugendo, ngita Mtwa daikela, ndihuvilala kukala kwa nyenye kwa chipindi chidodo.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Ila kwa chipini ichi, dandisigala baha mumwani va Ifeso, mbaka pekikwacha kigono kya Pendikosite. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Kwakuva Nguluvi anigavile chipindi chinofu va kugita kasi ngomi, mumwani ugu, ata ngita vagehe vanu volofu vevakunipinja.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Ila Timotewo peikwacha kwa nyenye, mumuwanuke unofu neke abihile kuvecha na uwogofi, kwakuva mwene igita kasi lya Mtwa ngita pendigita nene. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nondee, munu yeyonda abihile kumbeda, ila mumtange ayendelele na lugendo vake kwa lutengamaso, neke ache kwa nene, kwakuva nene na vadikila vangi tukumchindila.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Kutigila lukolo lwetu Apolo, ndimusukile hilo ache kwa nyenye pamwi na vadikila vangi, ila seikela kwacha nondee, ila daikwacha pala peipatila fwasi.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njowo cha kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Mwilolele na mugangamale muludikilo lwenu na muveche vakakatima na vene ludali. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Makani genu gyonda mugagite mulukelo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Vakolo vangu, mwichela kuva Setefani na vanu va kaye lyake, vawo ndi vanu va kwanja kumudikila Yesu Kilisito, mumwani va Akaya, navo vayihechile kuvatanga vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito. Nondee, ndikuvasuka hilo, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />muvapulikiche hilo vanu ngita avo na vangi vonda vevigita kasi iyi pamwi na vene.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Ndikeduka hilo kuva Setefani na Fotinato pamwi na Akaiko pevafikile, kwakuva ava vanigavile gala gendipwemuke kwakuva lya nyenye semukali baha. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Kwakuva vandikedusile numbula lyangu na numbula chenu ndeni. Ndeni, vanu ngita ava ving'ang'wa kuginywa.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Mipinga ga vanu vevamudikile Kilisito muinyi va Asia vakuvahungila. Akula na Pilisika, pamwi na vadikila va Kilisito, lyelitang'ana mukaye lyao, vakuvahungila mulitawa lya Mtwa. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Kangi, vakolo vonda vevagehe baha vakuvahungila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Mwihungile mwavene kuwonesa lukelo lwenu kwa Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nene Pauli ndisimbile baluwa iyi kwa liwoko lwangu mwene, ndikuvahungila. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Munu yeyonda yeseakumkela Mtwa na akotolwe. Mtwa vetu, wache!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Ndikumsuka Mtwa vetu Yesu avagavile usanzi vake.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Ndikuvakela nyenye vonda yemumdikiye Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>